PHASE 3: IMPLEMENTATION COMPLETE
---------------------------------
Completed: 2026-02-11

Summary of changes:

1. Enhanced POST /v1/sessions/:id/messages endpoint:
   - Added SSE streaming support via Node.js Readable stream
   - Emits canonical events (text-start, text-delta, tool-input-available, etc.)
   - Properly sets SSE headers (Content-Type: text/event-stream)
   - Async event emission with proper error handling

2. Implemented GET /v1/sessions/:id/messages/resume endpoint:
   - Supports resume functionality for AI SDK v6
   - Filters events by timestamp via "after" query param
   - Returns SSE stream of historical events
   - Compatible with DefaultChatTransport resume pattern

3. Enhanced agent-loop.ts with canonical event protocol:
   - Emits full suite of canonical events (text-*, tool-*, reasoning-*, finish)
   - Integrated with tool-executor for real tool invocation
   - Simulates tool detection based on user message content
   - Chunks text output for realistic streaming behavior
   - Includes usage metadata in finish event

4. Created event-adapter.ts module:
   - Bidirectional mapping between canonical and legacy event names
   - canonicalToLegacy(): Converts orchestrator events to WS middleware format
   - legacyToCanonical(): Converts WS events to canonical format
   - Batch conversion utilities for multiple events
   - Special handling for different event types (tool calls, messages, metadata)

5. Comprehensive test coverage:
   - sessions.test.ts: 15 tests for all session/message endpoints
   - event-adapter.test.ts: 16 tests for event conversion logic
